Description: local-first wallpaper library with optional X sync
 Wallkeep indexes and browses local image/video wallpaper collections,
 generates thumbnails, searches by source, detects exact and perceptual
 duplicates, rotates wallpapers and can set them through the desktop
 environment.
 .
 Optional X timeline sync is downloaded by gallery-dl. Wallkeep does not
 implement X scraping, GraphQL clients, cookie extraction or the downloader
 itself; it only manages the resulting files.
